OL,3,GNEWSAOrange Order has never 'shied
OL,4,Aaway' from Drumcree mediation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Orange Order has never "shied away"
OL,7,Ffrom mediation, the Portadown District
OL,8,FMaster has said, after a residents'
OL,9,Fgroup called for an international
OL,10,Fmediator to try to resolve the Drumcree
OL,11,Fparade dispute.
OL,13,FNigel Dawson was speaking after meeting
OL,14,Fthe Parades Commission on Wednesday.
OL,16,FThe five-person commission must decide
OL,17,Fwhether to allow the Orange Order to
OL,18,Fmarch from Drumcree church in Portadown
OL,19,Falong the mainly nationalist Garvaghy
OL,20,FRoad on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
